flowchart BT
    Done[Done] --> Report[Report]
    Task[Task] --> Done
    Task --> Task
    Retry[Retry] --> Task
    Task -->|failed| Retry
    Retry -->|give up| Dead[Dead letter]

    Sched[Scheduler] --> Task
